  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">for board transition and development</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Afrobarometer is a pan-African, nonpartisan survey research network that conducts public attitude surveys on democracy, governance, the economy, and society. The world&#x2019;s leading source of high-quality data on what Africans are thinking, it has a network of more than 30 national partners responsible for data collection, analysis, and in-country dissemination of findings. Afrobarometer&#x2019;s vision is a world in which Africa&#x2019;s development is anchored in the realities and aspirations of its people. Afrobarometer&#x2019;s approach focuses on making citizen voice a key pillar of African policy and decision making. This grant will support Afrobarometer&#x2019;s board development to manage governance leadership transition over the next year.</narrative>
  </description>
